target/
/.reference/
/output/
__pycache__/

# Run output. The benchmark harness writes captures and per-round stdout/stderr
# under /output; copying a run into the tree made 98 tracked files of one
# machine's driver banner. Quote the measured numbers in docs/ instead, and
# keep the raw logs where they were produced.
/docs/validation-logs/
*.stdout.txt
*.stderr.txt
# The worlds, at the working directory's own root. ANCHORED: an unanchored
# `saves/` matches any directory of that name at any depth, and it silently
# swallowed `crates/pbd-app/src/saves/` - the module that writes them - which
# would have committed a tree that does not build.
/saves/
